    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91818" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρπά̆λᾰμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cunningly wrought from
			fire</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. βέλος</span>, of the
			thunderbolt, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				10(11).80
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρπαλάμης: πυρπαλάμους ἔλεγον τοὺς διὰ
				τάχους τι μηχανᾶσθαι δυναμένους, καὶ τοὺς ποικίλους τὸ
				ἦθος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				513.30
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρπαλάμην: ὁ ταχέως τι ἐπινοῶν
				καὶ παλαμώμενος ἴσα πυρί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>; cf. foreg.</div>
